WEBVTT

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:06.000
SILVER  FANG

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.070
Galactic Shooting Star Silver
SILVER  FANG

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:08.210
GINGA NAGAREBOSHI   GIN
Galactic Shooting Star Silver
SILVER  FANG

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:10.420
SILVER  FANG
GINGA NAGAREBOSHI   GIN
Galactic Shooting Star Silver
SILVER  FANG

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:13.700
Galactic Shooting Star Silver
GINGA NAGAREBOSHI   GIN
SILVER  FANG

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:13.820
GINGA NAGAREBOSHI   GIN

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:28.990
<i>Madara, under Akakabuto's command,
followed and suddenly attacked John.</i>

00:01:34.850 --> 00:01:40.520
<i>Silver jumped in and saved John
from Madara's horrible claws.</i>

00:01:41.020 --> 00:01:45.560
<i>The wild dogs were
looking for capable males.</i>

00:01:45.770 --> 00:01:49.520
<i>Platoon commander Ben, saw
value in Silver and John-</i>

00:01:49.650 --> 00:01:52.770
<i>- and helped chase away Madara.</i>

00:01:52.910 --> 00:01:56.010
<i>Then the wild dogs' leader
called for them.</i>

00:01:56.260 --> 00:02:04.270
NOW! THE MALES DEPARTURE

00:02:10.510 --> 00:02:12.570
The leader is calling us.

00:02:15.890 --> 00:02:17.320
Everyone!, move out!

00:02:22.270 --> 00:02:23.200
Are you coming?

00:02:32.280 --> 00:02:35.670
I wonder what kind male
the leader is.

00:02:40.580 --> 00:02:45.870
<i>All commanders compete to get
there before his calling ends.</i>

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:49.830
<i>First is, the fifth Platoons
commander: Terry.</i>

00:02:50.210 --> 00:02:53.880
<i>Eighth Platoons commander: Karas.</i>

00:02:54.180 --> 00:02:57.710
<i>Elevens Platoons commander: Luke.</i>

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:17.450
Ouch! The others have
already arrived.

00:03:17.700 --> 00:03:21.700
We are the last?
Not good, Ben.

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:25.430
Come on!

00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:32.770
Ben is amazing.

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:37.820
Just a platoon officer.
He's not the opponent I'm after.

00:03:38.430 --> 00:03:39.860
What'cha mean, John?

00:03:40.730 --> 00:03:44.440
I'll defeat the leader
and take over the pack.

00:03:45.310 --> 00:03:46.490
What?

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:47.950
You will see.

00:03:49.610 --> 00:03:50.650
John!

00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:56.420
You're late!
First, second and third.

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:58.590
Have you forgotten the rules?

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:02.240
Answer at once!
What? Can't you hear me?!

00:04:02.370 --> 00:04:06.170
The delay is my fault, Commandant.

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:10.310
Hey, but Ben...

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:15.400
To save some males, we
had to fight Madara.

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:18.150
I take full responsibility for
the 3 platoons.

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:23.220
I'm sick of these excuses!
Rules are rules, and are to be followed.

00:04:24.310 --> 00:04:26.320
Ben is telling the truth!

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:27.240
Silver!

00:04:28.810 --> 00:04:32.500
Who the hell are you?
And what are you doing here?

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:35.170
I brought him here, Commandant.

00:04:35.240 --> 00:04:39.360
He's one of the males that
fought against Madara.

00:04:39.490 --> 00:04:40.540
Huh?!

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:49.420
Are you tupid!?
Possibly the other dork.

00:04:51.170 --> 00:04:54.310
But are you going to bring
a pup into the pack, Ben?

00:04:56.880 --> 00:05:02.570
Commandant, I vouch for that
he can fight, and is a real male.

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:03.680
Your bastard!

00:05:03.810 --> 00:05:07.360
Do you talk back to me!?
A mere platoon commander!

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:10.620
Now he starts to shout again.

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:13.870
Ben has gained more influence lately.

00:05:13.990 --> 00:05:18.500
The Commandant is afraid that
Ben will take his place.

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:40.680
You fool!
What are you doing?

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:51.160
I knew it.
You're my father!

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:52.280
What?!

00:05:52.280 --> 00:05:54.080
Silver, what are you saying?!

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:13.220
What are you doing?!

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:16.640
You bastard!
What a stupid thing to say!

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:19.020
And such rudeness
towards the Leader!

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:22.650
I'll bite you to death!

00:06:31.180 --> 00:06:34.490
Silver avoided the
Commandant's attack.

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:38.500
Not just that...
He's showing his fangs.

00:06:39.730 --> 00:06:41.290
You will die!

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:48.300
Stop it!

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:53.720
Sniper, you shouldn't go so far.

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:55.290
But Leader...

00:06:55.460 --> 00:07:00.640
It's like Ben says.
He is small, but a brave male.

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:03.650
And he says funny things.

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:07.260
To call me father.

00:07:08.260 --> 00:07:13.660
You make me happy, kid.
I accept your loyalty.

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:18.120
So are you!

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:23.000
Everyone here is my children!
My friends!

00:07:23.530 --> 00:07:25.090
Oh, that's it.

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:26.250
I got surprised.

00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:28.380
Don't joke around, Silver.

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:30.590
Say nothing more, Silver.

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:33.550
And you shouldn't
suck up too much.

00:07:37.830 --> 00:07:43.730
<i>I'm not sucking up.
He's my father! But why...</i>

00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:46.320
<i>My father is...</i>

00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:04.350
<i>...is...dead!</i>

00:08:05.950 --> 00:08:10.300
<i>And if it's father,
he should recognize me.</i>

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:16.180
Attention!

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:19.520
You all know that
there is something going on -

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:22.810
- in the Twin Pass where Akakabuto is!

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:29.260
We can no longer enter
Akakabuto's castle!

00:08:29.680 --> 00:08:31.520
<i>Akakabuto's castle?</i>

00:08:39.400 --> 00:08:45.290
He expands his power by getting
other bears under his command!

00:08:46.280 --> 00:08:51.460
We have gathered more fighters as well!

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:57.050
But this group is not enough!

00:09:02.630 --> 00:09:07.690
The world is big.
There are plenty of males in other places!

00:09:07.720 --> 00:09:12.480
I give you three months!
Recruit males from all over the country!

00:09:14.430 --> 00:09:16.860
Platoon 1-3: You are going south!

00:09:17.850 --> 00:09:21.990
Platoon 4-6: Head north!

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:25.910
Platoon 7-9: Head west!

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:28.420
And the rest is going east!
Understood?

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:30.310
Yes, sir!

00:09:31.110 --> 00:09:35.920
We gather here at the
new moon, in three months!

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:37.590
Departure is tomorrow morning!

00:09:47.590 --> 00:09:54.170
You can't be late to this fight.
When we meet again, the war begins!

00:10:30.470 --> 00:10:32.730
Silver, are you awake?

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:36.420
I'm gonna split.

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:40.400
I don't want to take over the pack.

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:43.120
They're crazy...

00:10:43.250 --> 00:10:45.910
To even think they can
defeat Akakabuto.

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:47.410
I'm sorry.

00:10:47.570 --> 00:10:48.660
John...

00:10:56.990 --> 00:10:58.420
Somebody's coming.

00:11:13.050 --> 00:11:18.270
<i>I don't get it?
Why does he call me "father"?</i>

00:11:20.220 --> 00:11:23.020
<i>I don't remember...
Why don't I remember?</i>

00:11:23.860 --> 00:11:28.030
<i>What did I do until
six months ago?</i>

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:20.530
As you can see, Mr. Sniper.
The little pup may be telling the truth.

00:12:21.280 --> 00:12:25.180
He resembles the Leader, but
I don't know...

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:29.130
Damn!
Typically Ben to recruit this one.

00:12:29.420 --> 00:12:35.810
If we do don't do anything, the Leader will
pass on the leadership to that little one.

00:12:36.170 --> 00:12:43.450
Then all our loyalty to
the leader will be wasted.

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:47.740
Never!
I won't allow that!

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:50.010
The next leader...

00:12:50.230 --> 00:12:52.070
Will be me!

00:12:58.320 --> 00:13:00.900
Ben... Ben!

00:13:01.200 --> 00:13:05.490
Wake up! I want to talk, Ben!

00:13:09.260 --> 00:13:12.180
He's exhausted, he doesn't even move.

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:15.130
Silver!
Hurry up, the sun will rise soon.

00:13:15.460 --> 00:13:20.090
Sorry Ben, but I have to go.
I'll be back for sure.

00:13:20.260 --> 00:13:21.730
I'll go in advance.

00:13:22.420 --> 00:13:23.680
Wait, John!

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:34.000
Don't, Ben!

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:37.560
You heard that he promised as a male.
He will definitely come back!

00:13:37.690 --> 00:13:42.610
He knows that it's forbidden to leave
the group, once you've joined!

00:13:44.510 --> 00:13:47.730
But...
What does it matter to you!

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:49.590
Cross...

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:53.790
He's just gonna say his last
farewell to that boy.

00:13:53.920 --> 00:13:57.980
Don't you wanna believe in him?

00:14:02.390 --> 00:14:08.640
He makes everyone believe.
Even though he is so young.

00:14:08.810 --> 00:14:14.650
Are you missing your puppies?
They would've been the same age.

00:14:14.680 --> 00:14:17.750
Ben, you promised not to bring that up!

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:21.240
Sorry, I didn't mean anything by it.

00:14:21.400 --> 00:14:25.380
Never again, do you understand!?

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:28.370
Oh Scary!
I understand...

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:32.520
You lost that argument.

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:38.520
If you argue with Cross,
there will be no dinner.

00:14:38.710 --> 00:14:43.340
Right! No one catches bird
as well as Cross.

00:14:45.890 --> 00:14:51.310
<i>All dogs here were basically
well-trained hunting dogs.</i>

00:14:51.480 --> 00:14:56.820
<i>Each with their own reason
to have left their master.</i>

00:14:57.790 --> 00:15:04.570
<i>Cross, eight years old.
The only bitch accepted as a male.</i>

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:12.360
<i>Before leaving, she was a
mother of puppies like Silver.</i>

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:19.050
<i>A year ago she came to the
Twin Pass with friends and master.</i>

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:46.170
Cross! Help me!

00:15:50.740 --> 00:15:54.410
<i>Cross fought to save her master.</i>

00:15:58.630 --> 00:16:01.710
<i>And everyone followed her lead...</i>

00:16:14.520 --> 00:16:19.060
<i>Her friends were killed by
Akakabuto, one by one.</i>

00:16:19.190 --> 00:16:24.610
<i>But she faithfully waited
to get help from her master.</i>

00:16:25.570 --> 00:16:30.700
<i>But her owner abandoned
the wounded dogs, and ran.</i>

00:16:31.490 --> 00:16:37.410
<i>Then Cross understood... That she
could never trust people again.</i>

00:16:38.580 --> 00:16:44.210
<i>All her friends were killed,
and she was the sole survivor.</i>

00:16:44.710 --> 00:16:49.510
<i>That's how the connection between
Cross and Akakabuto began.</i>

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:01.740
<i>I'll wait for you, boy!</i>

00:17:05.280 --> 00:17:12.160
Don't you understand, Silver?
No dogs are stronger than human rifles.

00:17:12.330 --> 00:17:15.990
Trust me. It's a bad idea
to go back to that pack.

00:17:16.120 --> 00:17:19.080
John, I disagree.

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:23.240
Do you really trust that dog
you mistook as your father?

00:17:23.380 --> 00:17:25.020
I wasn't mistaken!

00:17:25.390 --> 00:17:26.850
Let me say one thing...

00:17:26.900 --> 00:17:31.520
Only weaklings rely in a group.

00:17:32.140 --> 00:17:34.610
That leader is a good example.

00:17:36.280 --> 00:17:38.270
John! I will say goodbye here!

00:17:53.780 --> 00:18:00.120
Your eyes...
You're just a kid, but...

00:18:00.920 --> 00:18:04.330
But what, John?

00:18:04.710 --> 00:18:10.000
Your eyes has an effect
that attracts others.

00:18:10.130 --> 00:18:14.760
Even I get taken sometimes.

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:17.180
John...

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:20.450
Live well.

00:18:21.160 --> 00:18:22.200
You as well.

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:25.640
Take care of Daisuke
while I'm away.

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:28.650
Yes. But Silver...

00:18:29.030 --> 00:18:35.990
My master and I will probably kill
Akakabuto while you are away.

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:11.400
<i>Daisuke!</i>

00:19:19.340 --> 00:19:20.240
Silver...

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:27.490
Daisuke!

00:19:28.920 --> 00:19:30.700
Silver...

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:33.860
Mother! I...

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:37.360
...I'm gonna go away.

00:19:55.040 --> 00:20:02.080
You're so similar. Your eyes...
You look like your father.

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:04.800
Mother, I...

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:12.120
Never mind.
It was nothing, Mother.

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:20.970
Take care of...
Take care of Daisuke, please.

00:20:22.560 --> 00:20:24.100
Run along now!

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:39.360
<i>In the humid morning mist...</i>

00:21:40.940 --> 00:21:45.430
<i>The twelve dog platoons headed
out, one by one.</i>

00:21:58.460 --> 00:22:04.280
<i>Some to the west, others to the east.
They spread across Japan.</i>

00:22:04.490 --> 00:22:09.910
<i>But they all had the
same desire in their heart.</i>

00:22:10.760 --> 00:22:12.640
<i>To find more males.</i>

00:22:13.180 --> 00:22:16.430
<i>It was their call.</i>

00:22:17.230 --> 00:22:22.380
<i>Silver, chose not to think about whether
the leader was his father, or not.</i>

00:22:22.550 --> 00:22:27.510
<i>His blood as a bear dog
boiled at the thought of-</i>

00:22:27.720 --> 00:22:30.930
<i>- gathering males
to defeat Akakabuto.</i>

00:22:31.060 --> 00:22:36.850
<i>He was filled with warm memories
of his mother, and his friend Daisuke.</i>

00:22:37.150 --> 00:22:44.200
<i>But they were overwhelmed by the
expectation that burned in his body.</i>

00:22:46.870 --> 00:22:50.080
Run!
Run, Silver!
